f 4s has minimal strategic value for future plays, so using them now maximizes efficiency. This also gives my teammate a chance to potentially take control if both the Landlord and I cannot continue, allowing our team to coordinate the endgame better.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠4", "♣4"]}'}
